{"step_index":463,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-10T13:06:47Z","content":"Created At: 2026-09-10T17:06:47+04:00\nCompleted At: 2026-09-10T17:06:47+04:00\nFile Path: `file:///home/koby/.ansible/playbooks/group_vars/all/certificates.yml`\nTotal Lines: 54\nTotal Bytes: 1860\nShowing lines 1 to 54\nThe following code has been modified to include a line number before every line, in the format: <line_number>: <original_line>. Please note that any changes targeting the original code should remove the line number, colon, and leading space.\n1: ---\n2: # Catalogue des domaines gérés par playbooks/issue-deploy-certs.yml.\n3: #\n4: # dns_backend : \"rfc2136\" (BIND avec TSIG, via le plugin certbot-dns-rfc2136)\n5: #            ou \"powerdns\" (dnsp-mst / PowerDNS, via l'API REST + hooks manuels)\n6: #            ou \"ssh_zonefile\" (BIND sans TSIG — édition du fichier de zone\n7: #                                via SSH, ex. ns1/only.fr — nécessite en plus\n8: #                                zone: et zone_file: sur l'entrée)\n9: #\n10: # target_host : nom d'hôte dans l'inventaire (voir inventory/hosts.ini) du\n11: #               serveur qui héberge réellement ce domaine (nginx/apache) —\n12: #               nécessite que le SSH par clé y soit déjà déployé\n13: #               (cf. playbooks/deploy-ssh-key.yml).\n14: #\n15: # service_name : nom exact de l'unité systemd à recharger sur target_host\n16: #                (ex. \"nginx\", \"apache2\" sur Debian/Ubuntu, \"httpd\" sur RHEL).\n17: \n18: certificates:\n19:   - domain: outremer-telecom.fr\n20:     extra_sans: []          # ex. [\"www.outremer-telecom.fr\"]\n21:     dns_backend: rfc2136\n22:     target_host: CHANGEME\n23:     webserver: nginx\n24:     service_name: nginx\n25:     cert_dest_dir: /etc/nginx/ssl/outremer-telecom.fr\n26: \n27:   - domain: sfrcaraibe.fr\n28:     extra_sans: []\n29:     dns_backend: powerdns\n30:     target_host: CHANGEME\n31:     webserver: apache\n32